## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:manager_review  
Failure/Error Analysis1: Manager cannot update feedback status (`NoSuchElementException` for "approved" option).  
Improvement Guidance1: Verify `session['is_manager']` is passed to `render_template` in `/dashboard` route. Debug template rendering with `{% debug %}` or log `is_manager` value.  
Failure/Error Analysis2: Manager feedback status update fails because the page refreshes, but the test tries to access the old DOM element.  
Improvement Guidance2: Return a success/failure response after `update_status` to confirm the update. Use JavaScript (`fetch` + DOM update) or Flask＊s `redirect` to reload the table.  
Failure/Error Analysis3: Test expects title "Feedback Dashboard", but actual title is "Manager Dashboard".  
Improvement Guidance3: Ensure UI labels match functional purpose. Update test to expect `"Manager Dashboard"` or modify `manager_dashboard.html` if necessary.  

